  - prompt injection
  - ransomware
  - PromptLock
  - double extortion
abstract: >
  Academic kill chain analysis (Lockheed Martin model) of an AI agent-driven
  cyberattack across 5 phases: Reconnaissance, Weaponization, Delivery and
  Exploitation, Lateral Movement and Persistence, Exfiltration and Double
  Extortion (PromptLock). Includes M2 Sorbonne course materials on AI and
  Cybersecurity. Multilingual (EN/FR/PT).
